      "question": "In a certain code language, \"chalks are sticks\" is written as \"de se ro\", \"sticks is pen\" is written as \"ne de vi\", and \"pen are notebook\" is written as \"ra vi se\". How is \"pen\" written in that code language?",
      "questionHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In a certain code language, &quot;chalks are sticks&quot; is written as &quot;de se ro&quot;, &quot;sticks is pen&quot; is written as &quot;ne de vi&quot;, and &quot;pen are notebook&quot; is written as &quot;ra vi se&quot;.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">How is &quot;pen&quot; written in that code language?</span></p>\n",
