      "question": "In a certain code language, 'movie and novel' is written as 'la se pa', 'watching a movie' is written as 'do pa re' and 'reading a novel' is written as 'la ni do'. What is code for 'and' in that language?",
      "questionHtml": "In a certain code language, &#39;movie and novel&#39; is written as &#39;la se pa&#39;, &#39;watching a movie&#39; is written as &#39;do pa re&#39; and &#39;reading a novel&#39; is written as &#39;la ni do&#39;.&nbsp; What is code for &#39;and&#39; in that language?",
