          "id": "C",
          "text": "ni",
          "html": "ni"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "pa",
          "html": "pa"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>From the given information,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/F1_Pooja%20Sharma_19.2.21_Pallavi_D11.png\" style=\"width: 365px; height: 130px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>The code for &#39;<strong>movie</strong>&#39; is &#39;<strong>pa</strong>&#39;.</p>\n\n<p>The code for &#39;<strong>nove</strong>l&#39; is &#39;<strong>la</strong>&#39;.</p>\n\n<p>The remaining word is <strong>&#39;and&#39;</strong> and the remaining code is<strong> &#39;se&#39;</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>So, the code for &#39;and&#39; is &#39;se&#39;.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<strong>&quot;se&quot;</strong>.</p>\n",
