      "questionHtml": "In a code language, &#39;sweet fruits&#39; is written as &#39;re de&#39;, &#39;mango is sweet&#39; as &#39;de me ke&#39;, &#39;orange is citrus&#39; as &#39;ke le pe&#39;, &#39;eat orange&#39; as &#39;pe ne&#39; Is encrypted. What will be the code for the word &#39;citrus&#39;?",
