      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Given:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&#39;sweet fruits&#39; is written as &#39;re de&#39;,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&#39;mango is sweet&#39; <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">is written&nbsp;</span>as &#39;de me ke&#39;,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&#39;orange is citrus&#39; <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">is written&nbsp;</span>as &#39;ke le pe&#39;,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&#39;eat orange&#39; <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">is written&nbsp;</span>as &#39;pe ne&#39;<br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/01/F1_SSC_Savita_8-1-24_D10.png\" style=\"width: 385px; height: 210px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Here,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&#39;</span><strong>citrus</strong><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&#39; is coded as&nbsp;&#39;le&#39;.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&quot;Option 4&quot;</span>.</p>\n",
